      answerHtml: `<p>It works well if you use the Veterans Expressway, and less well if you rely on US-41. Lutz sits roughly <strong>15 miles north of Tampa</strong>, and most commuters take the Veterans (a toll road) or Dale Mabry Highway south toward Westshore and downtown; I-275 is the alternative from the 33549 side.</p><p>The Veterans is the reliable option at rush hour and a real part of why the 33558 communities command what they do. Expect a longer run than <a href="/carrollwood/" class="text-link hover:underline">Carrollwood</a> and a shorter one than Wesley Chapel. If your office is in Westshore rather than downtown, Lutz is a materially better commute than anything on the east side of the county.</p>`,
