        "Westchase is the highest-priced and fastest-moving market in this group. Across 356 Stellar MLS closed sales in ZIP 33626 for the twelve months ending October 2026, single-family homes closed at a median of about $700,000 at just 15 days on market, the shortest median marketing time of any community covered here. Townhomes closed near $460,000 at about 29 days, and condos around $215,000. The all-property median was roughly $550,000 at 24 days. Fifteen days is effectively no negotiating window, so if you are buying in Westchase, have your financing and your inspector lined up before you tour.",
      answerHtml: `<p>Westchase is the highest-priced and fastest-moving market in this group. Across 356 Stellar MLS closed sales in <strong>ZIP 33626</strong> for the twelve months ending October 2026, single-family homes closed at a median of about <strong>$700,000 at just 15 days on market</strong> the shortest median marketing time of any community covered here. Townhomes closed near $460,000 at about 29 days, and condos around $215,000. The all-property median was roughly $550,000 at 24 days.</p><p>Fifteen days is effectively no negotiating window. If you are buying in Westchase, have financing and an inspector lined up before you tour. Call (813) 733-7907 to get positioned ahead of the next listing.</p>`,
