      answerHtml: `<p>Westchase and the surrounding northwest Hillsborough neighborhoods draw from a well-regarded set of <a href="https://www.hillsboroughschools.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-link hover:underline">Hillsborough County</a> public schools. At the elementary level that includes <strong>Westchase Elementary</strong> at 9517 W Linebaugh Avenue, plus Lowry, Mary Bryant, and Deer Park. Middle school is <strong>Davidsen</strong>, at 10501 Montague Street inside 33626, or <strong>Farnell</strong>. High school is <strong>Alonso</strong> or <strong>Sickles</strong> depending on address.</p><p>Hillsborough County also runs a choice program, so your zoned school and your options are different lists. Use the district's Find Your Neighborhood School tool for the specific address before you let school zoning drive the decision.</p>`,
